  "description": "Scheduler is a simple job scheduling framework in C# that allows you to easily define and execute scheduled tasks in the background. This project provides a flexible base class for creating scheduled jobs, a background service for managing job execution, a static api to register your background services dynamically, and an extension method for integrating the scheduler into your application.",
